# Project Root Marker

This file is intended as a marker to indicate the root directory of the
project. It helps tools and scripts identify the top level of the project's
hierarchy and should not be removed.

# Purpose:
- Assist in project navigation.
- Ensure tools operate within the correct directory context.
- Prevent the scanning of directories outside the project scope.

Please do not delete or move this file unless you are reorganizing the
project's structure. If you are unsure about the implications of modifying
this file, please consult with the project lead or your team.

# Note:
This file does not contain configuration data or metadata influencing
project behaviour.
